# Transcity (brand wordmark) is a free-for-PERSONAL-USE demo font. The 1001Fonts
# FFP licence permits webfont conversion and embedding, but NOT publishing or
# redistribution (§6, §7) — and this repo is public, so committing the file
# would be distributing it. It stays local; a fresh clone falls back to Inter.
# See frontend/public/fonts/README.md before changing this.
transcity/
frontend/public/fonts/*.woff2
frontend/public/fonts/*.woff
frontend/public/fonts/*.otf
frontend/public/fonts/*.ttf
